        answer_en: "🎨 **Color Systems:**\n\n- **RGB (Red, Green, Blue):** \"Light-based\" system for screens (Web, UI). Highly vibrant.\n- **CMYK (Cyan, Magenta, Yellow, Black):** \"Ink-based\" system for physical printing. Slightly duller than screens.\n- **Pantone (PMS):** Pre-mixed spot colors used to guarantee 100% brand color accuracy in printing.\n- **HSL:** Adjusting colors via their Hue (base color), Saturation (intensity), and Lightness.\n\n💡 On Affinity PC V3, you have precise control over all these color profiles via the Color Studio and Swatches Panel, ensuring perfect color management.",
        chips: ["តើ RGB និង CMYK ខុសគ្នាម៉េច? 🖨️ (design 0)","តើ sRGB និង Adobe RGB ខុសគ្នាម៉េច? 🌈 (design 0)","តើ HSL គឺជាអ្វី? 🎛️ (design 0)"],
        chips_en: ["RGB vs CMYK? 🖨️ (design 0)","sRGB vs Adobe RGB? 🌈 (design 0)","What is HSL? 🎛️ (design 0)"]
